n  |==============                                                        |  20%\n  |                                                                            \n  |==============                                                        |  21%\n  |                                                                            \n  |===============                                                       |  21%\n  |                                                                            \n  |===============                                                       |  22%\n  |                                                                            \n  |================                                                      |  22%\n  |                                                                            \n  |================                                                      |  23%\n  |                                                                            \n  |=================                                                     |  24%\n  |                                                                            \n  |=================                                                     |  25%\n  |                                                                            \n  |==================                                                    |  25%\n  |                                                                            \n  |==================                                                    |  26%\n  |                                                                            \n  |===================                                                   |  26%\n  |                                                                            \n  |===================                                                   |  27%\n  |                                                                            \n  |===================                                 